POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "geengeregistreerd@mailadres.com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123"
}

### F3 - Login with a missing field: expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ontbrekende@informatie.com"
}

### Feature 3 - Admin tokens
### F3 - Login as admin: expect 200 with token and role ADMIN (needs the seeded admin account)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mail.com",
  "password": "Demo-Restpartij-2026"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### F3 - Login as collector: expect 200 with token and role COLLECTOR
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "di-test@mail.com",
  "password": "MyTestPassword123"
}

> {% client.global.set("collectorToken", response.body.token); %}

### Feature 3 - Status monitoring (US-08)
### F3 - Run maintenance without a token: expect 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/maintenance/expire

### F3 - Run maintenance as collector: expect 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/maintenance/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{collectorToken}}

### F3 - Run maintenance as admin: expect 200 with the report (lapsedReservations, expiredProducts)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/maintenance/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### F3 - Run maintenance again right after: expect 200 with zero and zero
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/maintenance/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Feature 3 - Admin overview (US-09)
### F3 - Overview without a token: expect 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products

### F3 - Overview as collector: expect 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{collectorToken}}

### F3 - Overview without a filter: expect 200, every status except REMOVED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### F3 - Overview filtered on one status: expect 200, only LISTED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products?status=LISTED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### F3 - Overview filtered on two statuses: expect 200, LISTED and RESERVED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products?status=LISTED&status=RESERVED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### F3 - Overview of removed products: expect 200, only REMOVED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products?status=REMOVED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### F3 - Overview with an unknown status: expect 400, field status, allowed values in the message
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products?status=BESTAATNIET
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Feature 3 - Admin delete (US-09)
### F3 - Delete without a token: expect 401
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/1

### F3 - Delete as collector: expect 403
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{collectorToken}}

### F3 - Delete a listed product: expect 204 (pick the id of a LISTED product from the seed data)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### F3 - Delete the same product again: expect 404 (a removed product does not exist for the API)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### F3 - Delete a reserved product: expect 204, the reservation lapses first (pick a RESERVED id from the seed data)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### F3 - Delete a collected product: expect 409 (pick a COLLECTED id from the seed data)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### F3 - Delete an unknown product: expect 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### F3 - Delete with an id that is not a number: expect 400, field id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/products/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}